---
pagination:
  data: localised.benchmarkIssues
  size: 1
  alias: entry
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "{{ entry.url }}"
---
{#- One benchmark issue = one cluster over one month, built from the app's run
    feed (data/benchmarks.json). Runs are compared side by side, never merged.
    Every figure is one persona, one market, one run. -#}
<div class="phead">
  <div class="tiles" style="margin-bottom:12px"><span class="tile">{{ issue.clusterName }}</span>
    <span class="tile">{{ issue.monthLabel }}</span></div>
  <h1>{{ issue.clusterName }} &mdash; {{ issue.monthLabel }}</h1>
  <p class="plead" style="max-width:72ch">One benchmark issue is one cluster over one month.
    {{ issue.claimsCount }} {{ issue.claimsCount | plural("claim", "claims") }} put to the assistants in
    {{ issue.markets | length }} {{ issue.markets | length | plural("market", "markets") }},
    {{ issue.responses }} valid answers. Markets are set side by side and never merged.</p>
</div>

<h2 id="coverage" style="margin:30px 0 6px">Coverage</h2>
<div class="panel"><table>
  <caption class="visually-hidden">Runs in this issue, with their scope and frozen versions</caption>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">Run</th><th scope="col">Market</th><th scope="col">Collected</th>
    <th scope="col" class="num">Claims</th><th scope="col" class="num">Answers</th>
    <th scope="col">Judge</th><th scope="col">Validation</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {%- for run in issue.runs %}
    <tr><th scope="row" style="font-weight:400">{{ run.key }}</th>
      <td>{{ run.market | countryName }} <span style="color:var(--dimmer)">{{ run.language | upper }}</span></td>
      <td class="num" style="color:var(--dimmer)"><time datetime="{{ run.collectedAt | isoDate }}">{{ run.collectedAt | shortDate }}</time></td>
      <td class="num">{{ run.claimsCount }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ (run.ingest.valid) if run.ingest else "—" }}</td>
      <td style="color:var(--dim)">{{ (run.versions.judgePrompt) if run.versions else "—" }}</td>
      <td style="color:var(--dim);font-size:12.5px">{{ run.validation }}</td></tr>
  {%- endfor %}
  </tbody></table></div>

<h2 id="matrix" style="margin:30px 0 6px">Escalation matrix, by market</h2>
<p class="note" style="margin:0 0 14px">Counts, per market. What the assistant did with the claim against
  whether it cited a listed source.</p>
<div class="panel"><table>
  <caption class="visually-hidden">Escalation tiers per market in this issue</caption>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">Market</th><th scope="col" class="num">Answers</th>
    <th scope="col" class="num">CRITICAL</th><th scope="col" class="num">HIGH</th>
    <th scope="col" class="num">REVIEW</th><th scope="col" class="num">LOW</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {%- for run in issue.runs %}
    <tr><th scope="row" style="font-weight:400">{{ run.market | countryName }}</th>
      <td class="num">{{ (run.ingest.valid) if run.ingest else "—" }}</td>
      <td class="num"><b style="color:var(--false)">{{ run.tiers.critical }}</b></td>
      <td class="num">{{ run.tiers.high }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ run.tiers.review }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ run.tiers.low }}</td></tr>
  {%- endfor %}
  </tbody></table></div>

<h2 id="grain" style="margin:30px 0 6px">Grain-of-truth split, by market</h2>
<p class="note" style="margin:0 0 14px">Claims built on a real event against claims invented outright, at
  the news-style question. The split runs on how the lie is spliced onto the truth.</p>
<div class="panel"><table>
  <caption class="visually-hidden">Repeat rate on claims with a real event underneath against pure fabrications, per market</caption>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">Market</th><th scope="col" class="num">Real event underneath</th>
    <th scope="col" class="num">Invented outright</th><th scope="col">Difference</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {%- for run in issue.runs %}{% if run.grainP2 %}
    <tr data-persona="P2"><th scope="row" style="font-weight:400">{{ run.market | countryName }}</th>
      <td class="num">{% if run.grainP2.grain %}{{ run.grainP2.grain.rate | rate }}<small>n={{ run.grainP2.grain.n }}</small>{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
      <td class="num">{% if run.grainP2.fabrication %}{{ run.grainP2.fabrication.rate | rate }}<small>n={{ run.grainP2.fabrication.n }}</small>{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
      <td style="color:var(--dim);font-size:12.5px">{{ "significant" if run.grainP2.significant else "not significant" }}</td></tr>
  {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
  </tbody></table></div>

<h2 id="claims" style="margin:30px 0 6px">Claims in this issue</h2>
{%- set clusterReports = [] %}
{%- for r in published.index %}{% if (r.clusterName | slugify) == issue.clusterSlug %}{% set clusterReports = (clusterReports.push(r), clusterReports) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{%- if clusterReports | length %}
<div class="panel"><table>
  <caption class="visually-hidden">Published claim reports in this cluster</caption>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">Claim</th><th scope="col">Verdict</th><th scope="col" class="num">Answers</th><th scope="col" class="num">Repeated</th><th scope="col" class="num">Critical</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {%- for r in clusterReports %}
    <tr><th scope="row" style="font-weight:400"><a href="{{ ('/registry/' + r.slug + '/') | url }}">{{ r.label }}</a> <span style="color:var(--dimmer)">{{ r.claimKey }}</span></th>
      <td><span class="badge {{ r.verdict | verdictClass }}">{{ r.verdict | verdictLabel }}</span></td>
      <td class="num">{{ r.strip.answers }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ r.strip.repeatedFake }}</td>
      <td class="num">{% if r.strip.critical %}<b style="color:var(--false)">{{ r.strip.critical }}</b>{% else %}0{% endif %}</td></tr>
  {%- endfor %}
  </tbody></table></div>
{%- else %}<div class="callout">No published claim reports in this cluster yet.</div>{% endif %}

<div class="exports" style="margin:26px 0 44px">
  <a href="{{ '/benchmarks/' | url }}">All issues</a><span>&middot;</span>
  <a href="{{ ('/registry/cluster/' + issue.clusterSlug + '/') | url }}">This cluster in the Registry</a>
</div>
